[[FSE STAGE type=proscenium width=10 depth=8 units=m]]
[[FSE ENTITY door type=entrance pos=5,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY sam type=cast pos=0,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY alex type=cast pos=-3,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY jo type=cast]]

INT. BATHROOM

[[FSE MOVE sam pos=alex facing=alex]]

She goes to him.

[[FSE MOVE sam pos=alex until=arrive]]

She's already there.

[[FSE ARRIVE sam]]

[[FSE ENTER jo from=door pos=alex]]

Jo comes in, straight to Alex.
